{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "88cecd84-e1d3-83ce-95cd-ac1930543686",
  "created_at": "2026-03-06T12:51:53-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Frank Conti",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:49:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:49:09-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Kevin. My name is Frank Conti. I want to report a pothole, or what's left of one. The cold patch they put in last week washed right out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:49:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, yeah, with the rain coming down today I'm not surprised. Where's this at?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:49:25-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's right in front of 366 Pelham Street. Up on the Hill. The patch was in maybe a week and now it's all gravel and a hole again, bigger than before."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:49:36-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "366 Pelham, got it. So the patch from last week is gone and the hole's reopened. Is it in the travel lane or over by the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:49:46-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Travel lane. Right where you'd drive through. I called my landlord first and she said that's the city's street, not hers. And I said, well, that's what I figured, so here I am."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:49:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, she's right, that's ours. I'm putting it in as a repeat on the same spot, which helps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:50:05-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Now, I got a question. If somebody hits that and it damages the car, does the city reimburse for that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:50:13-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a claims question, and I don't handle those here. Generally you'd file a claim with the city, and they look at it case by case. I can transfer you to the right office, or take your number and have them call you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:50:28-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I haven't hit it yet. I'm just asking. The fella next door said he bent a rim on one around the corner and they told him no. So I wanted to know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:50:39-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Best to ask the claims folks directly, because I don't want to tell you wrong. I can give you that number after we finish."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:50:48-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And how long do these usually take to fix? A week? A month?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:50:54-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Depends on the weather mostly. Cold patch is the stopgap in winter, and when it's wet like today they can't do much. Once it dries out, a crew can usually get to it in a few days to a couple weeks. Permanent paving waits until spring."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:51:10-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A couple weeks. Alright. I'll be driving around it till then. I'll tell you, I can't even listen to the radio to take my mind off it. The radio in my car only gets one station."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:51:23-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Ha, well, that'll make for a quiet ride. Okay, let me read this back. Pothole, travel lane, 366 Pelham Street, last week's cold patch washed out, reported Friday. And your name is Frank Conti, phone is 401-555-0170?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:51:36-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. 401-555-0170."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:51:38-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. I'll get it on the crew list. Want me to transfer you over to claims now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:51:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, go ahead and do that, please. Thanks, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:51:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, Frank. Hold on one second while I send you over."
    }
  ],
